Kumbhakarṇa strides flower showered royal road to Rāvaṇa palace --- Kumbhakarṇa embraces Rāvaṇa and asks the feared foe --- Rāvaṇa laments Rāma crossing ocean with Sugrīva host --- Rāvaṇa mourns ruined groves and slain chiefs and spent treasury --- Rāvaṇa begs Kumbhakarṇa to scatter the enemy like wind